<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman lowers Exxon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman lowers Exxon.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst William Randol lowered his rating on Exxon Corp to neutral from outperform, citing the stock's recent price gains.</p>
<p>-- Said in a report that investors would be better served owning other names such as Texaco Inc, Chevron Corp and Mobil Corp &quot;at far more attractive current valuations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Exxon eased 1/8 to 58-1/2.</p>
</text>
